const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"成交价会在买卖报价之间跳动",en:"Bid–ask bounce can create serial dependence"},body:{zh:"即使有效价格没有可预测变化，成交也可能交替发生在买价和卖价附近，造成相邻价格变化的负相关结构。Roll利用这个交易摩擦留下的统计痕迹估计价差。它不是把所有短期反转都认定为可获利的价格错误。",en:"Even without predictable movements in efficient value, transactions can alternate near bid and ask prices, leaving negative serial dependence in price changes. Roll uses this statistical footprint of trading friction to infer a spread. The argument does not classify every short-run reversal as a profitable pricing error."},reference:{url:"https://www.bauer.uh.edu/rsusmel/phd/roll1984.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1984年期刊版，第1128–1129页",en:"Source: 1984 journal article, pp. 1128–1129"}}},{title:{zh:"公式使用协方差，不是相关系数",en:"Covariance is not correlation"},body:{zh:"在论文假设下，有效价差等于相邻价格变化协方差取负号后的平方根，再乘以二。这里是协方差而非相关系数：后者已经除去尺度，不能直接代入得到价格单位的价差。计算前应明确变化量、滞后方向和配对观察值。",en:"Under the model, the spread is twice the square root of minus the covariance between adjacent price changes. This is covariance, not correlation: a scale-free correlation cannot be inserted to obtain a spread in price units. Specify the changes, lag direction and paired observations before calculation."},reference:{url:"https://www.bauer.uh.edu/rsusmel/phd/roll1984.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1984年期刊版，第1129页",en:"Source: 1984 journal article, pp. 1129"}}},{title:{zh:"价格变化与收益变化有不同单位",en:"Price changes and returns have different units"},body:{zh:"用价格差计算时，估计结果具有价格单位；使用收益的近似形式时，结果更接近比例口径。跨币种、复权方案或股票价格水平比较前，需要说明输入与缩放。隐含有效价差也不同于屏幕上的报价差，更不包含全部手续费与市场冲击。",en:"Using price differences produces a spread in price units; a return-based approximation instead has a proportional interpretation. Comparisons across currencies, adjustment schemes or price levels need explicit inputs and scaling. An inferred effective spread also differs from a displayed quoted spread and does not include every fee or market-impact cost."},reference:{url:"https://www.bauer.uh.edu/rsusmel/phd/roll1984.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1984年期刊版，第1129–1131页",en:"Source: 1984 journal article, pp. 1129–1131"}}},{title:{zh:"无法估计也是有信息的结果",en:"An unavailable estimate is a diagnostic"},body:{zh:"这个平方根表达式在样本协方差为负时给出正的价差。协方差为正时，实数范围内无法按原式得到价差，可能涉及样本噪声或假设不适用。此时应报告无法估计及其原因；擅自取绝对值或填零会改变方法，不应仍称为未经修改的原始估计。",en:"The square-root expression gives a positive spread for negative sample covariance. A positive covariance does not yield a real-valued spread under that expression and can reflect sampling noise or unsuitable assumptions. Report the estimation failure; silently taking an absolute value or filling zero changes the method rather than preserving the original estimator."},reference:{url:"https://www.bauer.uh.edu/rsusmel/phd/roll1984.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1984年期刊版，第1128–1130页",en:"Source: 1984 journal article, pp. 1128–1130"}}},{title:{zh:"换一个频率，结果为何会变？",en:"Sampling frequency tests the assumptions"},body:{zh:"论文比较日频和周频估计，发现明显差异，而理论中的简化假设并不预期这种差异。作者讨论了价格有效性与非平稳等解释。频率敏感性因此值得作为诊断保留，不能任意挑选数值较低的窗口来声称某只股票交易成本更小。",en:"Daily and weekly estimates differ materially in the paper, despite the simplified theory's sampling-interval implication. The author discusses efficiency and nonstationarity as possible explanations. Retain frequency sensitivity as a diagnostic instead of choosing whichever window produces the lowest number and declaring a stock cheaper to trade."},reference:{url:"https://www.bauer.uh.edu/rsusmel/phd/roll1984.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1984年期刊版，第1134–1135页",en:"Source: 1984 journal article, pp. 1134–1135"}}},{title:{zh:"先保留序列，再解释估计",en:"Preserve the sequence behind the estimate"},body:{zh:"准备数据时应核对成交价定义、复权、交易时段和缺失观察，并明确相邻记录是否真的是相邻交易或相邻时间窗。补零、跨停牌拼接或混合不同频率，都可能改变协方差。保留这些处理记录，才有条件区分交易摩擦与数据加工带来的反转。",en:"For new data, check transaction-price definitions, adjustments, sessions and missing observations. State whether adjacent records represent adjacent trades or time windows. Zero filling, joining across suspensions and mixing frequencies can alter covariance; documented treatment helps distinguish trading friction from reversals introduced during data preparation."},reference:{url:"https://www.bauer.uh.edu/rsusmel/phd/roll1984.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：1984年期刊版，第1128–1131, 1134–1135页",en:"Source: 1984 journal article, pp. 1128–1131, 1134–1135"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"Roll指标依赖有效价格与交易过程假设，是隐含价差估计，不是完整执行成本。样本协方差、采样频率和价格单位会改变可解释性，不能把公式失效静默改写成零成本。",en:"The Roll measure depends on assumptions about efficient prices and trading. It estimates an implicit spread, not total execution costs; sample covariance, frequency and price units constrain interpretation, and an invalid calculation is not evidence of zero cost."}};export{e as default};
